<title>FRANCE: Pinault-Printemps nine-month sales rise.</title>
<headline>Pinault-Printemps nine-month sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					56,727    vs   55,764</p>
<p>     - of which third quarter		 18,982    vs   18,577</p>
<p>NOTE - Pinault-Printemps-Redoute reported its</p>
<p>nine-month consolidated sales in the official bulletin BALO.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
